WEBVTT

00:08:29.471 --> 00:08:30.986
Hivyo tu.

00:08:30.986 --> 00:08:33.982
Lakini ni mara ngapi tunasimama?

00:08:33.982 --> 00:08:36.751
Tunaharakisha katika maisha.Hatuachi.

00:08:36.751 --> 00:08:41.012
Tunakosa nafasi kwa sababu hatuachi.

00:08:41.012 --> 00:08:46.089
Tunatakiwa kuacha.Tunatakiwa kunyamaza.

00:08:46.089 --> 00:08:49.183
Na tunatakiwa kutengeneza alama za tahadhari

00:08:49.183 --> 00:08:51.556
katika maisha yetu.

00:08:51.556 --> 00:08:55.048
Nilipokuwa Afrika miaka michache iliyopita

00:08:55.048 --> 00:08:56.530
nikarudi tena,

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:59.114
Niligundua maji.

00:08:59.114 --> 00:09:03.293
Nilipokuwa Afrika,sikuwa na maji ya kunywa.